{"id":"664342","name":"白糖糕","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/664342/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"220克"},{"name":"粘米粉","amount":"80克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"220克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"20克"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪油","amount":"10克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克糯米粉+80克粘米粉，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664342/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"克水烧至沸腾，加入20克糖。","img":"images/664342/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌至融化。","img":"images/664342/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盆中加入10克猪油，再慢慢倒入糖水。","img":"images/664342/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌至无干粉。","img":"images/664342/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/664342/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搓成长条。","img":"images/664342/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揪成35克一个的均匀的小剂子。","img":"images/664342/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取出一个小剂子，搓成40公分长的小条。","img":"images/664342/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"来回折成四折。","img":"images/664342/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"两边捏紧。","img":"images/664342/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"首尾相连，捏紧。","img":"images/664342/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"整理一下形状。","img":"images/664342/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"依次全部做完，白糖糕的生胚就好了。","img":"images/664342/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"油温四成热，依次下入生胚，留出空隙，以免粘连。","img":"images/664342/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"全程小火，炸至浮起。","img":"images/664342/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"捞出，沥干油。","img":"images/664342/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"撒上糖粉。","img":"images/664342/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"外脆里糯。","img":"images/664342/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"超级好吃。","img":"images/664342/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品图来一张。","img":"images/664342/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"来尝尝哦。","img":"images/664342/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}